      {
       "name": "ClockUpdate",
       "pure": true,
       "help": "One thing that can turn critical, asked with its health every frame. at: when it blows (below 0: no countdown); lastHp: its health the last time. Fired: once, when the countdown has run out.",
       "inputs": [
        {
         "name": "kind",
         "type": "enum",
